§§ `s 190 -- progress reports`

#ASSERT `Must I be given a progress report` `individual` `instructed` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `yes: this law practice must give me, free and within a reasonable period, a written report of my legal costs to date or since the last bill (s 190(1))`
#ASSERT `Must I be given a progress report` `individual` `instructed` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `yes, through the law practice that retained it for me: that practice must give me the report, and this one must give it the information (s 190(2))`
#ASSERT `Must I be given a progress report` `individual` `instructed` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `no: s 190 requires a report only on a reasonable request`
#ASSERT `Must I be given a progress report` `individual` `instructed` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `no: s 190 requires a report only on a reasonable request`
#ASSERT `Must I be given a progress report` `government` `instructed` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 195 -- interest on unpaid costs`

`on time` MEANS `the bill did not come more than 6 months after the matter was completed, or no other reason applies`
-- Bill 1 March 2026, matter completed 1 September 2025 (6 months to the day): interest from 31 March (30 days) at the
-- Cash Rate Target 4.35 plus 2 = 6.35.
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 2 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.36 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) FALSE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Completed 31 August 2025: 6 months ends 28 February 2026, so a bill of 1 March 2026 is late.
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 31 8 2025) `on time` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 31 8 2025) `the bill was not given within the 6 months, or was withdrawn, at my request (s 195(6)(b))` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `individual` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 31 8 2025) `a lump sum bill came within the 6 months, and the itemised bill was requested after them (s 195(6)(a))` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May my lawyer charge me interest` `government` `instructed` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 31 3 2026) TRUE 6.35 4.35 (`d` 1 9 2025) `on time` EQUALS NOTHING

